  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 10 × 18 + 216 ÷ 5 – 41 = 21.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 216 and 18 \n\nGiven: 10 × 18 + 216 ÷ 5 – 41 = 21\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 10 × 216 + __**18 ÷ 5**__ – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**10 × 216**__ + 3.6 – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ **__2160 + 3.6__** - 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**2163.6 - 41**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 2122.6 ≠ 21\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 10 and 41\n\nGiven: 10 × 18 + 216 ÷ 5 – 41 = 21\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 41 × 18 + __**216 ÷ 5**__ – 10 = 21\n\n⇒ __**41**____** × 18**__ + 43.2 – 10 = 21\n\n⇒ __**73**____**8 + 43.2**__ – 10 = 21\n\n⇒ __**781.2**____** – 10**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 771.2 ≠ 21\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 5 and 10\n\nGiven: 10 × 18 + 216 ÷ 5 – 41 = 21\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 5 × 18 + __**216 ÷ 10**__ – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**10 × 18**__ + 21.6 – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**180 + 21.6**__ – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**201.6 - 41**__ = 21\n\n⇒ 160.6 ≠ 21\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 18 and 5\n\nGiven: 10 × 18 + 216 ÷ 5 – 41 = 21\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 10 × 5 + __**216 ÷ 18**__ – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**10 × 5**__ + 12 – 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**50 + 12**__ - 41 = 21\n\n⇒ __**62 - 41**__ = 21\n\n⇒ **21 = 21**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option 4\"**.",
